// Armour - members of the "armor" item group of the config.
// Worn armour is a different shape than the item shape, so "body" gets its own poses.
// Placeholder values - tuned in game with the gem visual debug menu.
//
// Switched off until those placeholders are tuned: a gem floating in front of the chest is worse
// than no gem at all, and armour is the one case where everyone else sees it. The poses stay here
// as the starting point - set "hidden" to false to work on them, and leave it false once they sit
// where they should.
{
